Soft clusterers for NF-MCD Stage 4 (mean±sd over seeds 0,1,2; k = ground-truth community count)

Fixed a-priori hyperparameters (never tuned per dataset): softmax temperature tau = 0.5 * median
squared distance to nearest k-means center; fcm_adaptive_m ladder (1.5,1.3,1.2,1.1) accepting the
largest m with mean(U.max) >= 1/k + 0.25*(1-1/k); spectral_soft: 12-NN graph + k Laplacian
eigenvectors + kmeans_softmax; gmm: spherical covariance, n_init=3, reg_covar=1e-4.
Names: |cca = CCA fused content (default), |raw = raw-PCA content (content_features='raw_pca').

